  "scope": "D330 lossless radix-prefix queue packing: only current uint32-distance small heap changes, with32-bit words for bucket0..5 and complete node<2^21. Reconstruct high distance prefix from invariant last, preserve old prefix before redistribution; <=11lowbits+21nodebits fit32. Full64 original small-item fallback for larger bucket/node and original full-distance wide heap retained. Monotone64-distance bands/full64 path labels/stale checks/batch32/search/loader/defaults/flags/PGO unchanged; within-band extraction order can change but distances unrounded. Source/extra flow/unpack can lose. Requires independent monotone-band/multiset/prefix/31-32-64bit/0/MAX/wideID/redistribute/interleave/clear/grow/strict/race/Floyd/GCC/image/default/all29 proof if native warrants. No answer/cache/seed/host/harness/counter/exemption change.",
